---
import RoundedGrid from "../assets/RoundedGrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/5">
  <RoundedGrid />

  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-32 lg:py-14">
    <div class="relative items-center">
      <div
        class="flex flex-col justify-center w-full lg:flex-row lg:items-start">
        <div class="max-w-2xl px-6 ">
         
          <p class="text-white mt-12 text-xl text-vulcan-300">
            "I cannot express enough how invaluable 99Minds has been to our business. Their expertise and support were instrumental in helping us in migration of our POS System to connect to our BigCommerce Platform and help launch and scale our gift card program seamlessly across our online and in all of our stores globally."</p>
            <p class="text-white mt-4 text-xl text-vulcan-300">- Margee Paris, E-Commerce Manager, Birdsnest</p>
        </div>
        <div class="item-center">
          <img alt="E-Commerce Manager at Birdsnest shares experience with 99minds" class="rounded-2xl mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50 w-full" src="/assets/case-study/Birdsnest-CS2.svg">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
</section>
<section class="relative border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16">
  <div
      class="prose prose-blockquote:border-l-white prose-a:text-indigo-400 hover:prose-a:text-white prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:text-white prose-li:marker:text-indigo-500 text-vulcan-300 prose-code:text-white prose-blockquote:text-white/70 max-w-none">
<h2>
        RESULT 
      </h2>
      <p>Utilizing 99minds for program implementation accelerated Birdsnest’s gift card program launch, cutting down on time constraints while addressing tailored demands with exceptional responsiveness. Their flexibility and commitment to Birdsnest's unique requirements made them true collaborators throughout the process. </p>
<p>The team’s swift assistance not only boosted online and offline revenue but also provided round-the-clock support. Additionally, the seamless integration of the new ConnectPOS system, previously a daunting challenge, enhanced the efficiency and effectiveness of Birdsnest's gift card program.
</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

